:{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.4.stable and in 4.5.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7688) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12600KF (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nClasses that aren't exposed to scripting still get included in auto-completion for ClassDB methods.\n\n<img width=\"538\" height=\"109\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef8354ec-3883-46a4-a48e-5a6a0de889a8\" />\n\nNaturally, this cause an error and that is to be expected.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open up \"node_script.gd\" or click on the script on the node of the main scene\n- Fill in any non-exposed class (like EditorAbout)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[classdb_autocompletion.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22684642/classdb_autocompletion.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_